.geneseed-mirror/
# Project-scope runtime state the workflow plugin writes (.geneseed/workflow-runs/).
# Distinct from the USER-scope ~/.geneseed/ that holds the hook shim — same name, two
# scopes. Running a pipeline inside this checkout would otherwise leave it untracked.
.geneseed/
*.log

# Generated build output — derivable from src/ via `geneseed build`, never committed.
Harness/
# Exported deployed-vs-source improvements reports (geneseed diff --out). Auto-exports
# land inside the deployed harness dir, but a hand-aimed --out here stays personal.
improvements/
# Host-specific project-context manifest, if a build drops one at the repo root.
/context.json
# The bundle skeleton an emit leaves at the repo root when it is given no `--out` — which the
# suite and `tests/golden.mjs` both do, so a proof run drops these on every pass. ANCHORED with
# a leading slash on purpose: a bare `agents/` would also ignore `src/agents/`, which is the
# authored source these are rendered FROM. Left unignored they are invisible only while empty:
# the moment a run leaves a file in one, `copyCheckout` copies it into every harness fixture,
# for the same reason `*.tgz` below is ignored.
/agents/
/doctrines/
/laws/
/memory/
/modes/
/ontology/
/postures/
/skills/
# Agent Notebook — personal/agent scratch space, never committed (AGENT.md §5).
notebook/

# Brainstorming visual companion (transient)
.superpowers/

# Web UI: dev-only deps (dist/ is committed and MUST stay tracked)
web/node_modules/
# Stray vite cache when a build is invoked from the repo root instead of web/
/node_modules/
# `npm pack` output. Untracked and unignored, it would otherwise be copied into every
# harness fixture (`_copy_checkout` copies `git ls-files --cached --others`).
*.tgz

# Local working docs — dated specs, reviews, and superpowers plans are per-machine
# work artifacts (drafted, executed, then dropped), never distributed with the repo.
docs/specs/
docs/reviews/
docs/superpowers/

# macOS Finder metadata
.DS_Store
